`
  'fs.file.read-str': `
reads the whole file into a string
returns content ?str:
ok(str) - success, with the file content
nil     - the file is empty
err     - the file is not open or the read failed
content: ok=file content, nil=file empty, err=not opened or read failure
`
  'fs.file.size': `
gets the size of the open file (through fstat(fd), eliminating TOCTOU)
