returns n i64: total frame byte count
`
  'http3.encode-frame': `
Encode an HTTP/3 frame
frame-type: HTTP/3 frame type code (varint encoded, e.g. 0x00 DATA, 0x01 HEADERS)
payload: frame payload bytes (its length is varint-prefixed)
returns buf []byte: complete frame buffer concatenating type + length + payload
returns n i64: total frame bytes after encoding
`
  'http3.encode-header': `
Encode a single header in QPACK literal format
name: header name (encoded literally, not via the static table)
value: header value
returns buf []byte: byte buffer after QPACK literal encoding
returns n i64: actual bytes written into buf
`
  'http3.encode-headers': `
Encode multiple headers
names: header name array with the first count entries valid (fixed [16]str)
values: header value array paired with names (fixed [16]str)
count: number of header pairs to encode in this batch (<= 16)
