`
  'http3.encode-headers-frame': `
Encode a HEADERS frame
names: header name array (fixed [16]str, first count entries used)
values: corresponding header value array (fixed [16]str)
count: number of header pairs to encode
returns buf []byte: frame buffer with type HEADERS (0x01) and payload = QPACK header block
returns n i64: total frame byte count
`
  'http3.encode-settings-frame': `
Encode a SETTINGS frame (empty settings)
