writes a string to standard error followed by a newline
s: the string written to standard error followed by a newline
n: bytes written in total for the string plus the newline
`
  'io.out': `
writes a string to standard output (no newline)
s: the string written to standard output (no newline appended)
n: number of bytes actually written
`
  'io.outln': `
writes a string to standard output followed by a newline
s: the string written to standard output followed by a newline
n: bytes written in total for the string plus the newline
`
