s: JSON string
pos: start position of the number
next-pos: ok=position where the number ends (value already written to the node's num-val), nil=illegal format
`
  'json.json-pool.parse-str': `
parses a JSON string (starting at the opening quote)
node-idx: index of the node receiving the string value
s: JSON string
pos: position of the opening quote
next-pos: ok=position after the closing quote, nil=quote not closed or illegal escape
`
