  'link.link.empty': `
Reports whether the linked list is empty
Returns yes bool: true = empty, false = not empty
yes bool: true=size <= 0 (both head and tail pointers are -1)
`
  'link.link.full': `
Reports whether the node pool is full
Returns yes bool: true = full, false = not full
yes bool: true=free-head < 0 (the free list is exhausted, later inserts cannot get a new node)
