returns a type description string (e.g. 'PNG image', 'ELF executable', 'ASCII text', 'directory', 'unknown')
Detection order: directory > non-regular file > file extension > magic number > default 'data'.
kind str: 'directory', 'unknown (not found)', a description matched by extension or magic number, or the default 'data'
`
  'magic.get-extension': `
