  'map.hashmap-str-tmpl.clear': `
Clears the map (reallocates the occ vec; the old vec is released by the compiler's move
semantics)
`
  'map.hashmap-str-tmpl.contains': `
Reports whether a key exists
key: the key to check
found: whether the table contains that key
