  'map.hashmap-str-tmpl.hash': `
FNV-1a string hash
key: the string key to hash
idx: the FNV-1a hash masked into the slot range
`
  'map.hashmap-str-tmpl.init': 'Initialises the map'
  'map.hashmap-str-tmpl.is-empty': `
Whether the map is empty
empty: whether it contains no elements at all
`
  'map.hashmap-str-tmpl.len': `
Returns the number of elements
n: current number of live key/value pairs
`
  'map.hashmap-str-tmpl.put': `
Inserts or updates key→value; returns whether it was inserted
key: the string key to insert
val: the value to store
is-new: true=a new key was inserted, false=an existing value was overwritten
`
  'map.hashmap-str-tmpl.rehash': `
Grows the table and rehashes every occ==1 entry
new-cap: capacity after growth (typically a multiple of the current capacity)
`
  'map.hashmap-str-tmpl.remove': `
Removes a key (marks a tombstone; keys/vals are not cleared)
key: the key to delete
removed: whether something was actually deleted (unchanged when the key is absent)
