fd: file descriptor of the new UDP socket (-1 = failure)
`
  'net.net-udp-recvfrom': `
Receive UDP data
Returns bytes actually received (-1 = error, 0 = timeout)
fd: UDP socket file descriptor
buf: receive buffer (str, must be pre-allocated to at least n bytes)
n: maximum bytes to receive in one call
read-n: bytes actually received (-1 = error, 0 = timeout; the source address is not reported)
`
  'net.net-udp-sendto': `
Send UDP data to the given address
