  'noml.noml-pool.parse-bool': `
Parse true/false
s str: full source text
pos i64: start position of the literal (pointing at t or f)
val bool: the parsed bool value; fixed to false when ok=false
next i64: position after the literal; returns the original pos when ok=false
ok bool: true = parsed, false = not true/false here (fail has been called to record the error)
