  'tls.cipher-is-ecdhe': `
Whether a TLS 1.2 cipher suite uses ECDHE key exchange
Currently covers the four combinations of ECDHE-ECDSA/RSA with AES128-CBC-SHA256 and AES128-GCM-SHA256.
c i64: cipher suite code (TLS-CIPHER-* constants)
r bool: true = one of those four (ECDHE key exchange possible), false = other suites
`
  'tls.cipher-is-gcm': `
Whether a TLS 1.2 cipher suite uses the AEAD (AES-GCM) record format
Only ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256 and ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256.
c i64: cipher suite code (TLS-CIPHER-* constants)
r bool: true = AES-GCM records (explicit nonce required), false = CBC + HMAC format
`
