  'tls.conn.encrypt-record-13': `
TLS 1.3 AEAD record encryption and send
ct i64: original content type
data []byte: plaintext data
key [16]byte: AEAD key
iv [12]byte: AEAD IV
seq i64: sequence number of this record (incremented after each send, participates in nonce derivation)
returns ok bool: true = success
