  'tls.conn.handshake-12-body': `
Full TLS 1.2 handshake after ServerHello
(Certificate → [ECDHE: ServerKeyExchange] → ServerHelloDone → key exchange → CCS/Finished)
Depends on .cipher-id (recorded by read-server-hello / read-server-hello-13) and, for ECDHE, .client-priv/.client-pub
returns ok bool: true = success
`
  'tls.conn.init': 'Initialize the connection (not yet connected)'
